{"candidateAnswer":"An outdoor adventure trip with the family","evidence":"[D2:1 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, good to hear from you! Since we last talked, lots has been happening! Last weekend, I took my family on a road trip to Jasper. It was amazing! We drove through the Icefields Parkway and the glaciers and lakes were gorgeous. I got a shot of a glacier, check it out!\n[D2:3 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, thanks for asking! It was great - fresh air, peacefulness and a cozy cabin surrounded by mountains and forests made it feel like a real retreat.\n[D19:1 | 1:45 pm on 9 December, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, hope you're doing good. Wanted to share some amazing news - my partner is pregnant! We're so excited! It's been a while since we had a kiddo around.\n[D19:3 | 1:45 pm on 9 December, 2023] Evan: So excited and a bit nervous! It's been a while since I had a toddler around but I'm really looking forward to it. Parenthood is so rewarding. I still remember when my first child was born, the joy was amazing. Looking forward to witness the miracle of life and build more memories with my family!","itemId":"urn:uuid:e5bc70e4-8e75-5d54-900a-e44ba1c3aad4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ba7184dc7f303d8403c3234a21ff2d3117bdf645a7379bc7192e57f4a015053d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which type of vacation would Evan prefer with his family, walking tours in metropolitan cities or camping trip in the outdoors?","referenceAnswer":"camping trip in the outdoors","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ba7184dc7f303d8403c3234a21ff2d3117bdf645a7379bc7192e57f4a015053d"}}]}